              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Eleanor K"
            },
            "reviewBody": "These are excellent. My husband doesn't like dates and really liked them too. I did cut the sugar to a 1/2 cup, as dates are sweet, and may cut even more next time. I did use unsweetened coconut, that's all I had, and didn't miss the extra sweetness. I will be making again, often.",
